 "notes": "Boxes are the PDF widgets; only page 0 has any (the signature and its date have no widgets). Line 3a's seven checkboxes are separate widgets c1_1[0..6] in form order (individual, C corp, S corp, partnership, trust/estate, LLC, other) and map to the tax_classification enum with equals. The LLC entry box takes one letter (C/S/P), so it needs char_at + upper from the stored classification word. SSN (3 comb groups) and EIN (2 comb groups) are sliced from the dashed strings. City/state/ZIP is one line (join). Pathless: Requester's name and address (the requester's own data, not the vendor's), the FATCA exemption code and line 7 account numbers (not kept by this AP team)."
